msgid "# Runtime Guard"
msgstr "# 运行时防护"

msgid ""
"Runtime Guard is vLLM Ascend's online anomaly detection and incident "
"response layer. It watches decode-time signals (token repetition, garbled "
"output, non-finite logits, speculative acceptance drift, and more), writes "
"structured reports under `runtime/report/`, and optionally captures per-"
"request KV cache blocks via native device-to-host dump (`dump_kv`)."
msgstr ""
"Runtime Guard 是 vLLM Ascend 的在线异常检测与事件响应层。它监控解码阶段的信号（token 重复、输出乱码、非有限 "
"logits、投机接受率漂移等），将结构化报告写入 `runtime/report/` "
"目录，并可选地通过原生设备到主机转储（`dump_kv`）捕获每个请求的 KV cache 块。"

msgid "## When to use"
msgstr "## 适用场景"

msgid ""
"- Intermittent quality bugs: repetition, gibberish, sudden NaN/Inf\n"
"- Need on-call artifacts (JSON report + optional `.pt` KV slices) without patching the model\n"
"- Suspected KV issues: capture with `dump_kv` for offline inspection"
msgstr ""
"- 间歇性质量缺陷：重复、乱码、突然出现 NaN/Inf\n"
"- 需要值班排查产物（JSON 报告 + 可选的 `.pt` KV 切片），且无需修改模型\n"
"- 怀疑存在 KV 问题：使用 `dump_kv` 捕获以供离线检查"

msgid ""
"Default deployment: **detectors off, hot-reload off** — negligible overhead "
"until you enable features in `runtime_config.json`."
msgstr "默认部署：**检测器关闭，热重载关闭** —— 在 `runtime_config.json` 中启用功能之前，开销可忽略不计。"

msgid "## Quick start"
msgstr "## 快速开始"

msgid "**Detect + report only**"
msgstr "**仅检测 + 报告**"

msgid "**Detect + report + KV dump on hit**"
msgstr "**检测 + 报告 + 命中时 KV 转储**"

msgid ""
"Edit the live `runtime_config.json` (JSONC comments/trailing commas OK) and "
"set:"
msgstr "编辑运行中的 `runtime_config.json`（支持 JSONC 注释/尾随逗号）并设置："

msgid ""
"- `detector.<name>.enabled`: `true`\n"
"- `detector.<name>.on_trigger`: `[\"report\", \"dump_kv\"]`\n"
"- `dump.auto_max_times`: e.g. `3` (required for auto dump quota)"
msgstr ""
"- `detector.<name>.enabled`：`true`\n"
"- `detector.<name>.on_trigger`：`[\"report\", \"dump_kv\"]`\n"
"- `dump.auto_max_times`：例如 `3`（自动转储配额所必需）"

msgid ""
"**Manual one-shot dump (watermark):** start the server with "
"`runtime_config_hot_reload=true` first (startup overwrites the JSON from "
"defaults/overlay). Then edit the live file: set `dump.manual_dump` to `1`. "
"After it fires, raise to `2`, `3`, … for another capture. Setting a large "
"`N` while `done` is still `0` catch-up-dumps across that many later waves — "
"prefer bumping by 1. See "
"[runtime_config.md](../configuration/runtime_config.md#dump)."
msgstr ""
"**手动一次性转储（水位线）：** 首先以 `runtime_config_hot_reload=true` 启动服务器（启动时会用默认值/覆盖值重写 "
"JSON）。然后编辑运行中的文件：将 `dump.manual_dump` 设为 `1`。触发后，将其提高到 `2`、`3`……以进行另一次捕获。当 "
"`done` 仍为 `0` 时设置较大的 `N`，会在后续那么多个波次中进行追赶式转储 —— 建议每次递增 1。参见 "
"[runtime_config.md](../configuration/runtime_config.md#dump)。"

msgid "## Startup options"
msgstr "## 启动选项"

msgid ""
"Configure through `--additional-config` (or `LLM(..., "
"additional_config=...)`):"
msgstr "通过 `--additional-config`（或 `LLM(..., additional_config=...)`）进行配置："

msgid "| Key | Type | Description |"
msgstr "| 键 | 类型 | 描述 |"

msgid ""
"| `runtime_config_path` | str | Path to `runtime_config.json`. Default: "
"`<cwd>/runtime/config/runtime_config.json` |"
msgstr ""
"| `runtime_config_path` | str | `runtime_config.json` "
"的路径。默认：`<cwd>/runtime/config/runtime_config.json` |"

msgid ""
"| `runtime_config_hot_reload` | bool | Enable hot-reload (startup-only; not "
"a JSON field). `false` = static after startup (default) |"
msgstr ""
"| `runtime_config_hot_reload` | bool | 启用热重载（仅启动时；不是 JSON 字段）。`false` = "
"启动后静态（默认） |"

msgid ""
"| `runtime_config` | dict | Startup overlay merged into JSON defaults |"
msgstr "| `runtime_config` | dict | 合并到 JSON 默认值中的启动覆盖配置 |"

msgid ""
"| `runtime_report_dir` | str | Override report root (default "
"`<cwd>/runtime/report`) |"
msgstr "| `runtime_report_dir` | str | 覆盖报告根目录（默认 `<cwd>/runtime/report`） |"

msgid ""
"| `runtime_dump_dir` | str | Seed KV dump root `dump.dump_dir` (default "
"derived from report root). Hot-reload of `dump.dump_dir` in JSON wins after "
"startup |"
msgstr ""
"| `runtime_dump_dir` | str | 初始化 KV 转储根目录 "
"`dump.dump_dir`（默认从报告根目录派生）。启动后，JSON 中 `dump.dump_dir` 的热重载优先生效 |"

msgid ""
"See [Additional "
"Configuration](../configuration/additional_config.md#runtime_guard) and the "
"full [runtime_config reference](../configuration/runtime_config.md)."
msgstr ""
"参见 [附加配置](../configuration/additional_config.md#runtime_guard) 以及完整的 "
"[runtime_config 参考](../configuration/runtime_config.md)。"

msgid "## Architecture (summary)"
msgstr "## 架构（概要）"

msgid ""
"Design / ops runbooks live on the analysis branch "
"(`docs/source/developer_guide/Design_Documents/runtime_guard_{design,ops}.md`),"
" not in this product tree."
msgstr ""
"设计/运维手册位于分析分支（`docs/source/developer_guide/Design_Documents/runtime_guard_{design,ops}.md`），不在本产品目录树中。"

msgid "## On-disk layout"
msgstr "## 磁盘布局"

msgid ""
"Report JSON top-level includes `dump_attempted` (whether `dump_kv` was in "
"`on_trigger`, not whether D2H finished), `dump_arm_wave`, `dump_dir`, and "
"optionally `request_finished_at_dump` (finish-wave arm — KV may be "
"freed/reused). Same `(type, req_id)` is capped by `report.max_per_req` "
"(default 1); reaching the cap stops detection for that request. Wave backoff"
" (64, then doubles) spaces further writes when the cap is higher. Default "
"`on_trigger` includes `report`."
msgstr ""
"报告 JSON 顶层包含 `dump_attempted`（表示 `dump_kv` 是否在 `on_trigger` 中，而非 D2H "
"是否完成）、`dump_arm_wave`、`dump_dir`，以及可选的 `request_finished_at_dump`（完成波次触发 —— "
"KV 可能已被释放/复用）。相同的 `(type, req_id)` 受 `report.max_per_req` 限制（默认 "
"1）；达到上限后，该请求的检测将停止。波次退避（64，然后翻倍）在上限较高时拉开后续写入的间隔。默认 `on_trigger` 包含 `report`。"

msgid "## Detectors"
msgstr "## 检测器"

msgid "| Type | Stage | Typical use |"
msgstr "| 类型 | 阶段 | 典型用途 |"

msgid "| `token_repeat` | after sample | Stutter / repetition |"
msgstr "| `token_repeat` | 采样后 | 卡顿/重复 |"

msgid ""
"| `logits_finite` | before sample | NaN/Inf logits (``isfinite`` + gate; "
"default **async** ``.item()`` wait at after-sample — logits may be mutated "
"by grammar before wait; set ``item_sync: true`` for sync pre-sample "
"gate/kind). Hit resolves indices/kind then enqueues; after-sample drains. "
"Unattributable rows: warning only (no guessed / null-req report). |"
msgstr ""
"| `logits_finite` | 采样前 | NaN/Inf logits（``isfinite`` + 门控；默认在采样后**异步**等待 "
"``.item()`` —— 等待前 logits 可能被语法处理修改；设置 ``item_sync: true`` "
"以在采样前同步门控/类型判断）。命中时解析索引/类型后入队；采样后处理。无法归属的行：仅警告（不生成猜测的/空请求报告）。 |"

msgid ""
"| `spec_acceptance` | after spec | Spec-decode acceptance drift (via "
"`run_sample_phase` → `check_after_spec`; v2 stashes accept stats in "
"`postprocess_sampled`) |"
msgstr ""
"| `spec_acceptance` | 投机后 | 投机解码接受率漂移（通过 `run_sample_phase` → "
"`check_after_spec`；v2 将接受统计暂存于 `postprocess_sampled`） |"

msgid ""
"All detectors default to **disabled**. Enable individually under "
"`detector.<name>.enabled`."
msgstr "所有检测器默认**禁用**。可在 `detector.<name>.enabled` 下单独启用。"

msgid ""
"Online KV / position meta detectors are **not** in this release; use "
"`dump_kv` for KV capture (offline compare tooling ships later)."
msgstr "本版本**不包含**在线 KV/位置元数据检测器；请使用 `dump_kv` 进行 KV 捕获（离线对比工具将在后续版本提供）。"

msgid ""
"> **Wiring (v2 only):** `@runtime_guard_sample_tokens` covers post-pre-"
"sample hooks (`mark_finished` / `check_after_spec` / waves / "
"`check_after_sample` when host ids are ready). Pre-sample "
"`check_before_sample` is on the compute_logits wrap inside the sample "
"decorator (before grammar; `logits_finite` only — default async gate D2H "
"there, wait in after-sample; `item_sync: true` for blocking `.item()`). "
"After-sample for async scheduling **and** for v2 `AsyncOutput` (even under "
"sync scheduling) runs in `AscendAsyncOutput.get_output()` after D2H + "
"`num_sampled` trim — do not append padded `AsyncOutput.sampled_token_ids` in"
" the sync hook (W2-3 / D-11). Then drain `logits_finite` incidents and "
"enqueue CPU detector (`token_repeat`) on `ActionQueue` (finish does not "
"wait). `dump_kv` may still arm after `mark_finished` (finish can precede "
"after-sample); reports / `request_info` / `.pt` set "
"`request_finished_at_dump: true` in that case — KV may already be freed or "
"reused, so treat tensors as suspect. Reaped ids are refused at arm. "
"ModelRunner v1 is not wired."
msgstr ""
"> **接线（仅 v2）：** `@runtime_guard_sample_tokens` 覆盖采样前处理后的钩子（`mark_finished` /"
" `check_after_spec` / 波次 / 当主机 id 就绪时的 `check_after_sample`）。采样前的 "
"`check_before_sample` 位于采样装饰器内 compute_logits 包装上（语法处理之前；仅 `logits_finite` "
"—— 此处默认异步门控 D2H，在采样后等待；`item_sync: true` 用于阻塞式 `.item()`）。异步调度**以及** v2 "
"`AsyncOutput`（即使在同步调度下）的采样后处理在 D2H + `num_sampled` 裁剪之后于 "
"`AscendAsyncOutput.get_output()` 中运行 —— 不要在同步钩子中追加填充后的 "
"`AsyncOutput.sampled_token_ids`（W2-3 / D-11）。然后处理 `logits_finite` 事件，并在 "
"`ActionQueue` 上入队 CPU 检测器（`token_repeat`）（完成不等待）。`dump_kv` 仍可能在 "
"`mark_finished` 之后触发（完成可能先于采样后处理）；此时报告 / `request_info` / `.pt` 会设置 "
"`request_finished_at_dump: true` —— KV 可能已被释放或复用，因此应将张量视为可疑。已回收的 id "
"在触发时会被拒绝。ModelRunner v1 未接线。"

msgid "## Actions"
msgstr "## 动作"

msgid "| Action | Effect |"
msgstr "| 动作 | 效果 |"

msgid "| `report` | Write JSON incident report (+ metric counter) |"
msgstr "| `report` | 写入 JSON 事件报告（+ 指标计数器） |"

msgid ""
"| `dump_kv` | D2H paged KV for the request. **Last PP × all TP** (not other "
"PP stages): TP0 records dump jobs this step and writes `request_info.json` "
"(report-like metadata); the next wave-head claims the list (TP bus / merged "
"due-bus), then each last-PP TP rank (including TP0) does local D2H in "
"`end_of_wave_sync`. Same arm wave: each `req_id` at most once "
"(`queue_kv_dump` dedupes by `(wave, req_id)`; duplicate enqueue logs INFO). "
"Files: `{dump_root}/{type}/{req_id}/wave_<N>/request_info.json` and "
"`{dump_root}/{type}/{req_id}/wave_<N>/dp*_tp*_pp*_cp*/*.pt` |"
msgstr ""
"| `dump_kv` | 该请求的 D2H 分页 KV。**最后一个 PP × 所有 TP**（不含其他 PP 阶段）：TP0 在本步记录 dump "
"任务并写入 `request_info.json`（类似报告的元数据）；下一个 wave-head 认领该列表（TP 总线 / 合并的 due-"
"bus），随后每个最后一个 PP 的 TP rank（包括 TP0）在 `end_of_wave_sync` 中执行本地 D2H。同一 arm "
"wave：每个 `req_id` 至多一次（`queue_kv_dump` 按 `(wave, req_id)` 去重；重复入队记录 INFO "
"日志）。文件：`{dump_root}/{type}/{req_id}/wave_<N>/request_info.json` 和 "
"`{dump_root}/{type}/{req_id}/wave_<N>/dp*_tp*_pp*_cp*/*.pt` |"

msgid "Default `on_trigger` is `[\"report\"]`. Per-detector overrides:"
msgstr "默认 `on_trigger` 为 `[\"report\"]`。各检测器的覆盖配置："

msgid ""
"**KV dump rank coverage:** detection and reports stay on last-PP TP0. "
"`dump_kv` captures **last PP × every TP rank**. **Only last-PP × all TP** "
"join the merged due bus (config + dump); other processes poll the config "
"JSON. Wave head **submits** one TP0-sourced `broadcast([wave_idx, "
"config_due, dump_due])` (+ due-lane `broadcast_object`) to "
"`DueBitsBusWorker`; **end-of-wave drains** (due-bcast ideally finished "
"during forward). Detector dumps are delivered the **next** wave (+1); config"
" apply lands at that wave's end-of-wave drain. Assemble shards from the "
"`tp*` directories under the same `req_id`."
msgstr ""
"**KV dump 的 rank 覆盖范围：** 检测和报告保持在最后一个 PP 的 TP0 上。`dump_kv` 捕获**最后一个 PP × 每个 "
"TP rank**。**仅最后一个 PP × 所有 TP** 加入合并的 due bus（config + dump）；其他进程轮询 config "
"JSON。Wave head **提交**一个源自 TP0 的 `broadcast([wave_idx, config_due, "
"dump_due])`（+ due-lane 的 `broadcast_object`）到 `DueBitsBusWorker`；**wave "
"结束时排空**（due-bcast 理想情况下在前向过程中已完成）。检测器 dump 在**下一个** wave（+1）投递；config 应用在该 "
"wave 的 end-of-wave 排空时生效。从同一 `req_id` 下的 `tp*` 目录组装分片。"

msgid "## Performance"
msgstr "## 性能"

msgid ""
"- **No additional-config / defaults**: bind-only path; intended to be noise-free.\n"
"- **Hot-reload only** (`runtime_config_hot_reload=true`, all detectors off, dump off): on last-PP TP, the TP0 due-broadcast runs on the bus worker so the inference thread can overlap it with forward (C2); end-of-wave rate-limits a warning if the collective was not hidden. Other processes poll the config file.\n"
"- **Detectors on**: cost depends on enabled checks (light: `token_repeat`; heavier: `logits_finite` — default async gate overlaps sample; `item_sync: true` pays sync `.item()` each step).\n"
"- **dump_kv on hit**: detector arms queue for the **next** wave-head dump lane, then D2H at that wave's `end_of_wave_sync` (after bus drain / prepare). Manual dump D2H's locally at end-of-wave (no dump-job bcast). Idle/broadcast steps submit a cheap due-vector broadcast at wave-head; per-lane `broadcast_object` runs only when that lane is due. Finish-wave hits set `request_finished_at_dump` on the artifacts."
msgstr ""
"- **无额外配置 / 默认配置**：仅 bind 路径；旨在无噪声。\n"
"- **仅热重载**（`runtime_config_hot_reload=true`，所有检测器关闭，dump 关闭）：在最后一个 PP 的 TP 上，TP0 的 due-broadcast 在 bus worker 上运行，因此推理线程可以将其与前向重叠（C2）；如果该集合通信未被隐藏，end-of-wave 会限流一条警告。其他进程轮询配置文件。\n"
"- **检测器开启**：开销取决于启用的检查（轻量：`token_repeat`；较重：`logits_finite` — 默认异步门控与采样重叠；`item_sync: true` 每步都要付出同步 `.item()` 的开销）。\n"
"- **命中时 dump_kv**：检测器 arm 排队等待**下一个** wave-head 的 dump lane，然后在该 wave 的 `end_of_wave_sync` 时执行 D2H（在 bus 排空 / prepare 之后）。手动 dump 在 end-of-wave 时本地执行 D2H（无 dump-job bcast）。空闲 / 广播步骤在 wave-head 提交一个廉价的 due-vector 广播；per-lane 的 `broadcast_object` 仅在该 lane 到期时运行。Finish-wave 命中会在产物上设置 `request_finished_at_dump`。"

msgid ""
"Throughput A/B (with vs without Runtime Guard) should be measured on Ascend "
"hardware; it is not gated by default CI."
msgstr "吞吐量 A/B 对比（启用与不启用 Runtime Guard）应在昇腾硬件上测量；默认 CI 不对其进行门控。"

